faction Horde
levels 10-12
zone Durotar
keywords Speak with Un'thuwa, Ju-Ju Heaps, Un'thuwa, Uthel'nay, Thurston Xane, Sen'jin Village, Echo Isles, Zalazane, Speak with Anastasia, The Balnir Farmstead, Balnir Snapdragons, Anastasia Hartwell, Cain Firesong, Brill, Ley Staff, Ley Orb, Arcane Staff, Arcane Orb, Mage, class weapon
