why A staff or an off-hand orb at 10: Orcs and Trolls on the Echo Isles, the Undead at a Tirisfal farm.

# The Horde mage weapon quests at level 10, two chains that shut each other
# out (quests.json `excl`: 1881 and 1883 exclude each other's chain, 1882 and
# 1884 each other), so every Horde mage gets one:
# - Orcs and Trolls: Ju-Ju Heaps (1884) from Un'thuwa in Sen'jin Village: Ley
#   Orb (7508) or Ley Staff (9513). The breadcrumb Speak with Un'thuwa (1883,
#   Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar or Thurston Xane in Thunder Bluff) is not needed:
#   Ju-Ju Heaps has no prerequisite and Un'thuwa offers it on sight.
# - Undead: Speak with Anastasia (1881, Cain Firesong in Brill) and The Balnir
#   Farmstead (1882, Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity): Arcane Orb (7507) or
#   Arcane Staff (9514). Trolls may take this one too (race mask Undead,
#   Troll), but the Echo Isles are next door to their start.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json (Un'thuwa, the
# seven Ju-Ju Heaps 102986 on the Echo Isles, the Balnir Snapdragons 102985);
# quest_template in Forever's server data for the reward choices;
# data/local/mechanics (quest-steps, quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20) for the
# heaps inside the raised huts and their 30 second respawn, and the six
# snapdragon plants with a 3 second respawn that need no Herbalism.
# Why a Class guide: the Durotar route crosses the Echo Isles at about level 8,
# before the quest opens, and leaves for the Barrens from Razor Hill at 12; the
# Undead route (horde/undead/01-tirisfal-glades) carries 1881 and 1882.
# Each race takes its home town's quest; the steps after the pick-up follow
# whichever quest is in the log (`when onquest`), so a Troll who took Cain's
# quest or an Undead who took Un'thuwa's is guided too.
# Lint warns that The Balnir Farmstead is shut out once Ju-Ju Heaps is taken:
# true, and why the Balnir steps only run `when onquest` 1881/1882; no
# character plays both.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Pick up: Sen'jin or Brill

step Un'thuwa
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Durotar
  tip Un'thuwa, the troll mage trainer, stands in Sen'jin Village on the Durotar coast south of Razor Hill. Orcs coming from Orgrimmar can take Speak with Un'thuwa from Uthel'nay in the Valley of Spirits first; it is only a pointer and Un'thuwa gives Ju-Ju Heaps without it. Taking it shuts out the Undercity's Balnir Farmstead.
  level 10
  accept 1884 npc 5880                        -- Un'thuwa

step Cain Firesong (Brill)
  only Undead
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip At 10 Cain Firesong, the Brill mage trainer in the Gallows' End Tavern, sends you to Anastasia Hartwell in the Undercity. Taking it shuts out Ju-Ju Heaps; if Speak with Un'thuwa (from Orgrimmar or Thunder Bluff) is in your log, abandon it first or Cain cannot give you this one. (A Troll who took this one in Brill follows the Balnir steps; an Undead who took Ju-Ju Heaps in Sen'jin, the Echo Isles steps.)
  level 10
  accept 1881 npc 2128                        -- Cain Firesong

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Echo Isles

step The Ju-Ju Heaps
  only Orc,Troll,Undead
  when onquest 1884
  zone Durotar
  tip Wade across the shallows south-east of Sen'jin to the main Echo Isle, where Zalazane (level 10) holds his camp with Hexed and Voodoo Trolls (level 8). The heaps you can click are the skull piles inside the raised huts around his camp, one hut holding two, more in the huts to the north; the skulls lying on the ground outside cannot be clicked. Destroy four. There are seven and each comes back 30 seconds after it is destroyed.
  interact 102986 quest 1884.1                -- Ju-Ju Heap, four of them

step Back to Un'thuwa
  only Orc,Troll,Undead
  when onquest 1884
  zone Durotar
  tip The orb is an off-hand for a one-hand weapon; the staff is a two-hander.
  turnin 1884 choose 7508 9513                -- Un'thuwa: Ley Orb or Ley Staff

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Balnir Farmstead

step Anastasia Hartwell
  only Undead,Troll
  when onquest 1881
  zone Undercity
  tip Walk south from Brill to the Ruins of Lordaeron and take the lift down into the Undercity. Anastasia stands in the Magic Quarter, the north-east ring of the city.
  turnin 1881                                 -- Anastasia Hartwell
  accept 1882

step The Balnir Farmstead
  only Undead,Troll
  when onquest 1882
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip The Balnir Farmstead lies south-east of Brill, south of the road east to the Bulwark. The snapdragons grow in the farm's garden and look more like bushes than flowers; any of them will do and you need no Herbalism. They come back within seconds.
  collect 7227 quest 1882.1                   -- Balnir Snapdragons

step Back to Anastasia
  only Undead,Troll
  when onquest 1882
  zone Undercity
  turnin 1882 choose 7507 9514                -- Anastasia Hartwell: Arcane Orb or Arcane Staff
